hadiths[276]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1","[AI-translation] Tum Mujhe yaad karo, Main tumhein yaad karunga; Mera shukr ada karo aur nashukri na karo. [surah Al-Baqarah:152] Ae iman walo! Allah ko bahut zyada yaad karo. [surah Al-Ahzab:41] Aur Allah ko bahut yaad karne wale mardon aur yaad karne wali auraton ke liye Allah ne maghfirat aur bada ajr tayyar rakha hai. [surah Al-Ahzab:35] Tum apne Rab ko dil mein aajizi aur khauf ke sath, dhimi awaz mein, subah-sham yaad karo; aur ghafilon mein se na ho jao. [surah Al-A'raf:205] Jo apne Rab ko yaad karta hai aur jo yaad nahin karta—un ki misal zinda aur murda jaisi hai."
"2","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya main tumhein tumhare aamal mein sab se behtar, tumhare Malik ke nazdeek sab se pakiza, tumhare darjon mein sab se buland; tumhare liye sona-chandi kharch karne se behtar aur tumhare dushman se bhidkar un ki gardanein katne aur un ke tumhari gardanein katne se behtar [amal] na bataun? [Sahaba:] Kyun nahin! Farmaya: Allah Ta'ala ka zikr."
"3","[AI-translation] Allah Ta'ala farmata hai: Banda mere bare mein jaisa guman rakhta hai Main waisa hi hun; jab woh Mujhe yaad karta hai Main us ke sath hota hun. Woh Mujhe dil mein yaad kare to Main use apne pas yaad karta hun; woh Mujhe kisi majlis mein yaad kare to Main use us se behtar majlis mein yaad karta hun. Woh meri taraf ek balisht badhe to Main us ki taraf ek hath badhta hun; meri taraf ek hath badhe to Main us ki taraf do hath badhta hun; woh mere pas chalkar aaye to Main us ke pas daudkar aata hun."
"4","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Busr (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul! Islam ke ahkam mujh par bahut ho gae hain; mujhe koi aisi cheez bataiye jise main mazbuti se pakde rahun. Farmaya: Tumhari zuban hamesha Allah ke zikr se tar rahe."
"5","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Allah ki kitab se ek harf padhe us ke liye ek neki hai; aur neki [ka sawab] das guna. Main nahin kehta Alif-Lam-Mim ek harf hai, balke Alif ek harf hai, Lam ek harf hai aur Mim ek harf hai."
"6","[AI-translation] Hazrat Uqbah bin Amir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne farmaya: Hum Suffah mein the; Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamare pas tashreef laae aur farmaya: Tum mein se kaun chahta hai ke har roz subah Buthan ya Aqiq jaae aur wahan se bina gunah aur bina qata-rahmi ke kohan wali do oontniyan le aaye? Hum ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul! Hum sab yeh chahte hain. Farmaya: Kya tum mein se koi subah masjid jakar Allah Azza wa Jalla ki kitab ki do aayatein seekhega ya padhega nahin—woh us ke liye do oontniyon se behtar nahin hai? Teen [aayatein] teen [oontniyon] se, char [aayatein] char [oontniyon] se aur [aayaton ki tadad ke barabar] oontniyon se behtar hain."
"7","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo kisi jagah baithe aur wahan Allah ko yaad na kare, to woh us ke liye Allah ke nazdeek kami [aur nuqsan] hoga; aur jo kisi jagah lete aur wahan Allah ko yaad na kare, to woh bhi us ke liye Allah ke nazdeek kami hoga."
"8","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo log kisi majlis mein baithein aur wahan Allah ko yaad na karein aur apne Nabi par durud na bhejein—to woh un ke liye kami hogi; phir Allah chahe to unhein azab dega, aur chahe to unhein bakhsh dega."
"9","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo log aisi majlis se uthein jis mein unhon ne Allah ko yaad nahin kiya, to woh gadhe ki lash [se] uthne ki tarah utheinge; aur woh un ke liye hasrat hogi."
"10","[AI-translation] Sari tareefein us Allah ke liye hain, jis ne hamein maut [neend] ke baad zinda kiya; aur usi ki taraf lautna hai. [Neend se jagkar kahe]"
"11","[AI-translation] Allah ke siwa koi saccha mabud nahin; woh akela hai, us ka koi shareek nahin. Badshahat usi ki hai, tareef usi ki hai; woh har cheez par qadir hai. Allah pak hai; sari tareefein Allah ke liye hain; Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin; Allah sab se bada hai. Buland aur azmat wale Allah ki [madad] ke baghair gunah se bachne ki taqat aur ibadat ki quvvat nahin. Ae mere Rab! Mujhe bakhsh de."
"12","[AI-translation] Sari tareefein us Allah ke liye hain, jis ne mere jism mein mujhe aafiyat di, meri ruh lauta di aur mujhe apna zikr karne ki ijazat di."
"13","[AI-translation] Beshak aasmanon aur zameen ki paidaish mein aur raat-din ke badalne mein aql walon ke liye nishaniyan hain. [190] Jo Allah ko khade, baithe aur karwaton par [lete] yaad karte hain aur aasmanon aur zameen ki paidaish mein ghaur karte hain: Ae hamare Rab! Tune yeh bekar paida nahin kiya; Tu pak hai, hamein aag ke azab se bacha. [191] Ae hamare Rab! Tu jise aag mein dalega use to ruswa kiya; aur zalimon ka koi madadgar nahin. [192] Ae hamare Rab! Hum ne ek pukarne wale ko iman ki taraf pukarte suna: Apne Rab par iman lao—to hum iman laae. Ae hamare Rab! Hamare gunah bakhsh de, hamari buraiyan mita de aur hamein nekon ke sath maut de. [193] Ae hamare Rab! Apne rasulon ke zariye hum se jo wada kiya woh hamein de aur qiyamat ke din hamein ruswa na kar; beshak Tu wadakhilafi nahin karta. [194] To un ke Rab ne un ki dua qubul ki: Tum mein se kisi amal karne wale ka amal—mard ho ya aurat—Main zaya nahin karunga; tum ek-dusre [ka hissa] ho. Jinhon ne hijrat ki, apne gharon se nikale gae, meri rah mein sataye gae, lade aur qatl kiye gae—Main zarur un ki buraiyan mita dunga aur unhein aisi jannaton mein dakhil karunga jin ke neeche nehrein behti hain, Allah ki taraf se badle ke taur par; aur Allah ke pas hi behtareen badla hai. [195] Kafiron ka shahron mein ghumna tumhein dhokhe mein na dale. [196] Thoda-sa faida; phir un ka thikana jahannam hai, aur woh kitna bura bichhauna hai! [197] Lekin jo apne Rab se darte hain un ke liye jannatein hain—jin ke neeche nehrein behti hain, un mein hamesha rehne wale—Allah ki taraf se mehmaani ke taur par; aur Allah ke pas jo hai woh nekon ke liye behtar hai. [198] Aur ahle-kitab mein aise bhi hain jo Allah par aur tum par jo nazil hua aur un par jo nazil hua us par iman late hain, Allah ke samne aajizi karne wale; Allah ki aayaton ko thodi qeemat mein nahin bechte; un ka ajr un ke Rab ke pas hai; beshak Allah hisab mein jaldi karne wala hai. [199] Ae iman walo! Sabr karo, sabr mein jame raho, tayyar raho aur Allah se daro taake kamyab ho jao. [surah Aale-Imran:200]"
"14","[AI-translation] Sari tareefein us Allah ke liye hain, jis ne mujhe yeh libas pehnaya aur meri kisi taqat aur quvvat ke baghair mujhe yeh rozi ke taur par diya. [Kapde pehente waqt kahe]"
"15","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Tareef teri hi hai; Tune hi mujhe yeh pehnaya. Main is ki bhalai aur jis kaam ke liye yeh banaya gaya us ki bhalai Tujhse mangta hun; aur is ke shar se aur jis kaam ke liye yeh banaya gaya us ke shar se teri panah chahta hun. [Naya kapda pehente waqt]"
"16","[AI-translation] Purana karo, aur Allah Ta'ala [badle mein naya] dega. [Naya kapda pehnen wale se kahe]"
"17","[AI-translation] Naya pehno, tareef ke laiq jiyo, shaheed hokar maro. [Naya kapda pehnen wale ke liye dua]"
"18","[AI-translation] Allah ke naam se. [Kapda utarne se pehle kahe]"
"19","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Main khabasat aur khabison [nar wa mada jinnon-shaitanon] se teri panah chahta hun. [Baitulkhala jaane se pehle; shuru mein kahe: Allah ke naam se]"
"20","[AI-translation] [Ae Allah!] Teri maghfirat [chahta hun]. [Baitulkhala se nikalkar kahe]"
"21","[AI-translation] Allah ke naam se. [Wuzu se pehle kahe]"
"22","[AI-translation] Main gawahi deta hun ke Allah ke siwa koi saccha mabud nahin; woh akela hai, us ka koi shareek nahin. Aur main gawahi deta hun ke Muhammad us ke bande aur rasul hain. [Wuzu ke baad kahe]"
"23","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Mujhe bahut tauba karne walon mein kar de aur mujhe bahut pak rehne walon mein kar de."
"24","[AI-translation] Ae Allah, Tu pak hai; teri hi tareef hai; main gawahi deta hun ke tere siwa koi mabud nahin; Tujhse maghfirat chahta hun aur teri taraf tauba karta hun."
"25","[AI-translation] Allah ke naam se; main ne Allah par bharosa kiya; Allah ke baghair koi taqat-quvvat nahin. [Ghar se nikalte waqt kahe]"
"26","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Main gumrah hone ya gumrah kiye jaane, phisalne ya phislae jaane, zulm karne ya zulm sehne, jihalat karne ya mere sath jihalat kiye jaane se teri panah chahta hun."
"27","[AI-translation] Allah ke naam se hum dakhil hue, Allah ke naam se hum nikle aur apne Rab Allah par hum ne bharosa kiya. [Ghar mein dakhil hote waqt kahe]"
"28","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Mere dil mein nur de, meri zuban mein nur de, meri samaat mein nur de, meri basarat mein nur de, mere upar nur de, mere neeche nur de, mere daayein nur de, mere baayein nur de, mere aage nur de, mere peeche nur de; meri jaan mein nur de; mere liye nur badha de, mere liye nur azeem kar de, mujhe nur de aur mujhe nur bana de. Ae Allah! Mujhe nur de; mere putthon mein nur de, mere gosht mein nur de, mere khun mein nur de, mere balon mein nur de, meri khaal mein nur de. [Ae Allah! Meri qabr mein mere liye nur de aur meri haddiyon mein nur de.] [Mera nur badha de, mera nur badha de, mera nur badha de.] [Mujhe nur par nur ata kar.] [Masjid jaate waqt padhe]"
"29","[AI-translation] Azeem Allah ki, us ke kareem chehre ki aur us ki qadeem badshahat ki panah mein shaitane-rajeem se panah chahta hun. Allah ke naam se; Allah ke rasul par salat wa salam ho. Ae Allah! Mere liye apni rahmat ke darwaze khol de. [Masjid mein dakhil hote waqt padhe]"
"30","[AI-translation] Allah ke naam se; Allah ke rasul par salat wa salam ho. Ae Allah! Main Tujhse tere fazl ka sawal karta hun. Ae Allah! Mujhe shaitane-rajeem se mehfooz rakh. [Masjid se nikalte waqt padhe]"
"31","[AI-translation] Muazzin jo kahe wahi dohrae; lekin (namaz ki taraf aao aur kamyabi ki taraf aao) ki jagah kahe: Allah ke baghair koi taqat-quvvat nahin. Aur kahe: Main gawahi deta hun ke Allah ke siwa koi saccha mabud nahin; woh akela hai, us ka koi shareek nahin; Muhammad us ke bande aur rasul hain. Rab ke taur par Allah se, rasul ke taur par Muhammad se aur deen ke taur par Islam se main razi hun. [Azan sunkar kahe]"
"32","[AI-translation] Muazzin ka jawab pura karne ke baad Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par durud bheje."
"33","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Is kamil dawat aur qayam namaz ke Rab! Muhammad ko waseela aur fazeelat ata kar aur unhein us maqame-mahmud par pahuncha jis ka Tune un se wada kiya hai. [Azan ke baad padhe]"
"34","[AI-translation] Azan aur iqamat ke darmiyan apne liye dua kare; kyunke tab dua radd nahin hoti."
"35","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Mere aur meri khataon ke darmiyan duri kar de jaise mashriq aur maghrib ke darmiyan duri ki. Ae Allah! Mujhe meri khataon se pak kar de jaise safed kapda mail se pak kiya jata hai. Ae Allah! Mujhe meri khataon se barf, pani aur olon se dho de. [Namaz ki shuruati dua]"
"36","[AI-translation] Ae Allah, Tu pak hai; teri hi tareef hai; tera naam babarkat hai, teri azmat buland hai; tere siwa koi mabud nahin. [Namaz ki shuruati dua]"
"37","[AI-translation] Main ne apna chehra us ki taraf kar liya jis ne aasmanon aur zameen ko paida kiya, yaksu hokar; main mushrikon mein se nahin. Beshak meri namaz, meri qurbani, meri zindagi aur meri maut Allah Rabbul-aalamin ke liye hai, jis ka koi shareek nahin; isi ka mujhe hukm diya gaya hai aur main musalmanon mein se hun. Ae Allah! Tu hi Badshah hai; tere siwa koi mabud nahin; Tu hi mera Rab hai, main tera banda hun. Main ne apni jaan par zulm kiya, apne gunah ka iqrar kiya; mere sare gunah bakhsh de; tere siwa gunah koi nahin bakhshta. Mujhe behtareen akhlaq ki hidayat de; behtareen ki taraf tere siwa koi hidayat nahin deta. Us ki burai ko mujhse pher de; us ki burai ko mujhse tere siwa koi nahin pherta. Hazir [tere hukm par], khushbakhti [teri madad se]; sari bhalai tere hath mein hai; burai teri [taraf mansoob] nahin. Main tere [fazl] se hun aur teri [taraf] hun; Tu babarkat aur buland hai; Tujhse maghfirat chahta hun aur teri taraf tauba karta hun."
"38","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Jibrail, Mikail aur Israfil ke Rab; aasmanon aur zameen ke paida karne wale; ghaib aur hazir ke janne wale! Apne bandon ke darmiyan jin baaton mein woh ikhtilaf karte the Tu hi faisla karta hai; jin baaton mein ikhtilaf hua un mein apni ijazat se mujhe haqq ki hidayat de; beshak Tu jise chahta hai seedhe raste ki hidayat deta hai."
"39","[AI-translation] Allah sab se bada hai, bahut bada [teen bar]; Allah ke liye bahut zyada tareef [teen bar]; subah-sham Allah ki paki bayan karta hun. Shaitane-rajeem se—us ki phunk, thuk aur waswase se—Allah ki panah chahta hun. [Namaz ke shuru mein teen bar padhe]"
"40","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Tareef teri hi hai; Tu hi aasmanon aur zameen aur un mein jo hai us ka nur hai; tareef teri hi hai; Tu hi aasmanon aur zameen aur un mein jo hai use qayam rakhne wala hai; tareef teri hi hai; Tu hi aasmanon aur zameen aur un mein jo hai us ka Rab hai; tareef teri hi hai; aasmanon aur zameen aur un mein jo hai ki badshahat teri hi hai; tareef teri hi hai; Tu hi aasmanon aur zameen ka Badshah hai; tareef teri hi hai; Tu hi Haqq hai, tera wada haqq hai, tera qaul haqq hai, Tujhse mulaqat haqq hai, jannat haqq hai, jahannam haqq hai, nabi haqq hain aur Muhammad haqq hain. Ae Allah! Tere supurd hua, Tujh par bharosa kiya, Tujh par iman laya, teri taraf ruju kiya, tere [deen] ke liye dushmani ki, Tujhe hakim mana; main ne jo kiya aur jo muakhkhar kiya, jo chhipaya aur jo zahir kiya [woh] bakhsh de; Tu hi muqaddam karne wala hai, Tu hi muakhkhar karne wala hai; tere siwa koi mabud nahin. [Tahajjud ki shuruati dua]"
"41","[AI-translation] Rahman wa Raheem Allah ke naam se. Sari tareefein Allah Rabbul-aalamin ke liye hain. Rahman hai, Raheem hai. Roze-jaza ka Malik hai. Hum teri hi ibadat karte hain aur Tujhi se madad mangte hain. Hamein seedhe raste ki hidayat de; un ka rasta jin par Tune inaam kiya, un ka [rasta] nahin jin par ghazab hua aur na gumrahon ka. Aameen. [surah Al-Fatihah:1-7] Rahman wa Raheem Allah ke naam se. Kaho: Woh Allah ek hai. Allah beniyaz hai. Na us ne jana, na woh jana gaya. Aur us ka koi hamsar nahin. [surah Al-Ikhlas:1-4] [Namaz mein padhe]"
"42","[AI-translation] Mera Azeem Rab pak hai. [Ruku mein kahe]"
"43","[AI-translation] Ae Allah, ae hamare Rab, Tu pak hai; teri hi tareef hai; ae Allah, mujhe bakhsh de. [Ruku aur sajde mein kahe]"
"44","[AI-translation] Bahut pak, bahut muqaddas; farishton aur Ruh [Jibrail] ka Rab. [Ruku aur sajde mein kahe]"
"45","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Tere liye ruku kiya, Tujh par iman laya, tere supurd hua; tere samne jhuke meri samaat, basarat, maghz, haddi, nas aur mere qadam jo uthate hain—Allah Rabbul-aalamin ke liye. [Ruku mein kahe]"
"46","[AI-translation] Jabarut, malkut, kibriya aur azmat wale [Allah] ki paki. [Ruku aur sajde mein kahe]"
"47","[AI-translation] Allah ne us ki sun li jis ne us ki tareef ki. [Ruku se uthte waqt kahe]"
"48","[AI-translation] Ae hamare Rab! Teri hi tareef, bahut, pakeeza aur babarkat tareef. [Ruku se uthkar kahe]"
"49","[AI-translation] [Teri hi tareef] aasman bhar, zameen bhar, dono ke darmiyan jo hai bhar aur is ke baad Tu jo chahe woh bhar [miqdar]. Tareef aur buzrugi ke laiq! Bande ka kaha sab se saccha kalam; hum sab tere bande hain: ae Allah! Tu jo de use rokne wala nahin, Tu jo roke use dene wala nahin; aur maldar ka maal tere pas faida nahin deta."
"50","[AI-translation] Mera Aala Rab pak hai. [Sajde mein kahe]"
"51","[AI-translation] Ae Allah, ae hamare Rab, Tu pak hai; teri hi tareef hai; ae Allah, mujhe bakhsh de. [Sajde mein kahe]"
"52","[AI-translation] Bahut pak, bahut muqaddas; farishton aur Ruh [Jibrail] ka Rab. [Sajde mein kahe]"
"53","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Tere liye sajda kiya, Tujh par iman laya, tere supurd hua; mere chehre ne use sajda kiya jis ne use paida kiya, surat di, us ki samaat aur basarat kholi; behtareen Khaliq Allah babarkat hai. [Sajde mein kahe]"
"54","[AI-translation] Jabarut, malkut, kibriya aur azmat wale [Allah] ki paki. [Sajde mein kahe]"
"55","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Mere sare gunah bakhsh de: chhote-bade, pehle-peeche, khule-chhipe. [Sajde mein kahe]"
"56","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Tere ghazab se teri raza ki, teri saza se tere maaf karne ki panah chahta hun; Tujhse teri hi panah chahta hun; teri tareef gin nahin sakta; Tu waisa hi hai jaisi Tune apni tareef ki. [Sajde aur witr mein padhe]"
"57","[AI-translation] Ae mere Rab, mujhe bakhsh de; ae mere Rab, mujhe bakhsh de. [Do sajdon ke darmiyan kahe]"
"58","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Mujhe bakhsh de, mujh par raham kar, mujhe aafiyat de, mujhe hidayat de, mujhe rozi de [aur mujhe buland kar]. [Do sajdon ke darmiyan kahe]"
"59","[AI-translation] Mere chehre ne use sajda kiya jis ne use paida kiya aur apni taqat wa quvvat se us ki samaat aur basarat kholi; behtareen Khaliq Allah babarkat hai. [Tilawat ke sajde mein kahe]"
"60","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Is ke badle mere liye apne pas ajr likh de, is ke badle mujhse bojh utar de, ise mere liye apne pas zakheera bana de aur mujhse ise qubul kar le jaise apne bande Dawud se qubul kiya. [Tilawat ke sajde mein kahe]"
"61","[AI-translation] Sari taazeemein, namazein aur pakeeza kalimaat Allah ke liye hain. Ae Nabi! Aap par salam aur Allah ki rahmat wa barkatein. Hum par aur Allah ke nek bandon par salam. Main gawahi deta hun ke Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin aur main gawahi deta hun ke Muhammad us ke bande aur rasul hain. [Tashahhud]"
"62","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Muhammad par aur Muhammad ki aal par rahmat farma jaise Ibrahim par aur Ibrahim ki aal par rahmat farmae; beshak Tu hamd wala, buzrugi wala hai. Ae Allah! Muhammad ko aur Muhammad ki aal ko barkat de jaise Ibrahim ko aur Ibrahim ki aal ko barkat di; beshak Tu hamd wala, buzrugi wala hai. [Namaz mein durud]"
"63","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Muhammad par, un ki azwaj par aur un ki zurriyat par rahmat farma jaise Ibrahim ki aal par rahmat farmae. Aur Muhammad ko, un ki azwaj ko aur un ki zurriyat ko barkat de jaise Ibrahim ki aal ko barkat di; beshak Tu hamd wala, buzrugi wala hai."
"64","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Main qabr ke azab se, jahannam ke azab se, zindagi-maut ke fitne se aur Masih Dajjal ke fitne ke shar se teri panah chahta hun. [Salam pherne se pehle namaz mein padhe]"
"65","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Main qabr ke azab se teri panah chahta hun; Masih Dajjal ke fitne se teri panah chahta hun; zindagi-maut ke fitne se teri panah chahta hun. Ae Allah! Main gunah aur qarz se teri panah chahta hun."
"66","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Main ne apni jaan par bahut zulm kiya; tere siwa gunah koi nahin bakhshta; apni taraf se maghfirat se mujhe bakhsh de aur mujh par raham kar; beshak Tu hi bahut bakhshne wala, nihayat raham wala hai."
"67","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Main ne jo kiya aur jo muakhkhar kiya, jo chhipaya aur jo zahir kiya, jo zyadati ki aur jo Tu mujhse behtar janta hai [woh] bakhsh de; Tu hi muqaddam karne wala hai, Tu hi muakhkhar karne wala hai; tere siwa koi mabud nahin."
"68","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Tere zikr mein, tere shukr mein aur khubsurat ibadat mein meri madad farma. [Har farz namaz ke baad padhe]"
"69","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Main bukhl se teri panah chahta hun, buzdili se teri panah chahta hun, zaleeltareen umr ki taraf lautae jaane se teri panah chahta hun; duniya ke fitne aur qabr ke azab se teri panah chahta hun."
"70","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Main Tujhse jannat mangta hun aur aag se teri panah chahta hun."
"71","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Ghaib ke ilm aur makhluq par qudrat ke waste—mere liye zindagi behtar jante hue mujhe zinda rakh, maut behtar jante hue mujhe maut de. Ae Allah! Chhipe-khule mein tera darr mangta hun; raza-ghazab mein haqq baat mangta hun; ghina-faqr mein miyanarwi mangta hun; na khatm hone wali nemat mangta hun; na tutne wali aankhon ki thandak mangta hun; faisle ke baad raza mangta hun; maut ke baad aaramdeh zindagi mangta hun; nuqsandeh takleef aur gumrahkun fitne ke baghair tere chehre ke deedar ki lazzat aur teri mulaqat ka shauq mangta hun. Ae Allah! Hamein iman ke zewar se aarasta kar aur hamein hidayatyafta hadi bana."
"72","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Main Tujhse mangta hun—Tu hi ek, yakta, beniyaz hai; jis ne na jana, na jana gaya, jis ka koi hamsar nahin—mere gunah bakhsh de; beshak Tu hi bahut bakhshne wala, nihayat raham wala hai."
"73","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Main Tujhse mangta hun—tareef teri hi hai; tere siwa koi mabud nahin, akela, beshareek; bahut ehsan karne wala, aasmanon-zameen ka paida karne wala, jalal wa ikram wala!"
"74","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Main Tujhse mangta hun—main gawahi deta hun ke Tu hi Allah hai; tere siwa koi mabud nahin, ek, beniyaz; jis ne na jana, na jana gaya, jis ka koi hamsar nahin."
"75","[AI-translation] Main Allah se maghfirat chahta hun [teen bar]. Ae Allah! Tu hi salam hai, Tujhi se salamti hai; Tu babarkat hai, ae jalal wa ikram wale. [Farz namaz ke baad padhe]"
"76","[AI-translation] Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin; woh akela hai, beshareek. Badshahat usi ki hai, tareef usi ki hai; woh har cheez par qadir hai. Ae Allah! Tu jo de use rokne wala nahin, Tu jo roke use dene wala nahin; maldar ka maal tere pas faida nahin deta. [Farz namaz ke baad padhe]"
"77","[AI-translation] Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin; woh akela hai, beshareek. Badshahat usi ki hai, tareef usi ki hai; woh har cheez par qadir hai. Allah ke baghair koi taqat-quvvat nahin. Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin; hum sirf usi ki ibadat karte hain. Nemat usi ki hai, fazl usi ka hai, khubsurat tareef usi ki hai. Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin—us ke liye deen ko khalis karte hue, chahe kafir napasand karein."
"78","[AI-translation] Allah pak hai, tareef Allah ke liye hai, Allah sab se bada hai [har ek taintees bar]; Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin; woh akela hai, beshareek. Badshahat usi ki hai, tareef usi ki hai; woh har cheez par qadir hai. [Farz namaz ke baad padhe]"
"79","[AI-translation] Rahman wa Raheem Allah ke naam se. Kaho: Woh Allah ek hai. Allah beniyaz hai. Na us ne jana aur na woh jana gaya. Aur us ka koi hamsar nahin. [surah Al-Ikhlas:1-4] Rahman wa Raheem Allah ke naam se. Kaho: makhluq ke shar se subah ke Rab ki panah chahta hun; andhera chha jaane par raat ke shar se; girhon mein phunkne waliyon ke shar se; hasad kare to hasid ke shar se. [surah Al-Falaq:1-5] Rahman wa Raheem Allah ke naam se. Kaho: logon ke Rab, logon ke Badshah, logon ke mabud ki panah chahta hun; peeche hatne wale waswasa dalne wale ke shar se; jo logon ke seenon mein waswasa dalta hai; jinnon aur insanon [mein se]. [surah An-Naas:1-6] [Har namaz ke baad padhe; Maghrib aur Fajr ke baad teen-teen bar]"
"80","[AI-translation] Allah; us ke siwa koi mabud nahin; woh zinda hai, qayam rakhne wala hai; use oongh-neend nahin pakadti. Aasmanon-zameen mein jo hai usi ka hai. Us ki ijazat ke baghair us ke pas kaun sifarish karega? Un ke aage-peeche jo hai woh janta hai; us ke ilm mein se kuch nahin gherte—woh jo chahe us ke siwa. Us ki kursi aasmanon-zameen ko ghere hai; un ki hifazat use thakati nahin; woh buland, Azeem hai. [Aayatul-Kursi; har namaz ke baad padhe]"
"81","[AI-translation] Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin; woh akela hai, beshareek. Badshahat usi ki hai, tareef usi ki hai; woh zinda karta hai aur maut deta hai; woh har cheez par qadir hai. [Maghrib aur Fajr ke baad das-das bar padhe]"
"82","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Main Tujhse faidemand ilm, pakeeza rozi aur qubul hone wala amal mangta hun. [Fajr ke salam ke baad kahe]"
"83","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Main tere ilm ke waste bhalai mangta hun, teri qudrat ke waste taqat mangta hun aur tere bade fazl se mangta hun; Tu hi qadir hai, main qadir nahin; Tu hi janta hai, main nahin janta; Tu hi ghaib ka janne wala hai. Ae Allah! Tu janta ho yeh kaam mere deen, rozi aur kaam ke anjam mein mere liye behtar hai—to mere liye muqaddar kar de, aasan kar de, is mein barkat de. Aur Tu janta ho yeh kaam mere deen, rozi aur kaam ke anjam mein mere liye bura hai—to use mujhse pher de, mujhe bhi us se pher de; jahan bhi bhalai ho mere liye muqaddar kar de, phir mujhe us par razi kar de. [Istikhara ki dua: do rakat nafl ke baad padhe; yeh kaam ki jagah hajat ka zikr kare]"
"84","[AI-translation] Tareef sirf Allah ke liye hai; salat wa salam us par jis ke baad koi nabi nahin [Muhammad]. [Istikhara jaisi duaon ke shuru mein kahe]"
"85","[AI-translation] Shaitane-rajeem se Allah ki panah chahta hun. Allah; us ke siwa koi mabud nahin; woh zinda hai, qayam rakhne wala hai; use oongh-neend nahin pakadti. Aasmanon-zameen mein jo hai usi ka hai. Us ki ijazat ke baghair us ke pas kaun sifarish karega? Un ke aage-peeche jo hai woh janta hai; us ke ilm mein se kuch nahin gherte—woh jo chahe us ke siwa. Us ki kursi aasmanon-zameen ko ghere hai; un ki hifazat use thakati nahin; woh buland, Azeem hai. [surah Al-Baqarah:255 – Aayatul-Kursi; subah-sham padhe]"
"86","[AI-translation] Rahman wa Raheem Allah ke naam se. Kaho: Woh Allah ek hai. Allah beniyaz hai. Na us ne jana aur na woh jana gaya. Aur us ka koi hamsar nahin. [surah Al-Ikhlas:1-4] Rahman wa Raheem Allah ke naam se. Kaho: makhluq ke shar se subah ke Rab ki panah chahta hun; andhera chha jaane par raat ke shar se; girhon mein phunkne waliyon ke shar se; hasad kare to hasid ke shar se. [surah Al-Falaq:1-5] Rahman wa Raheem Allah ke naam se. Kaho: logon ke Rab, logon ke Badshah, logon ke mabud ki panah chahta hun; peeche hatne wale waswasa dalne wale ke shar se; jo logon ke seenon mein waswasa dalta hai; jinnon aur insanon [mein se]. [surah An-Naas:1-6] [Subah-sham teen-teen bar padhe]"
"87","[AI-translation] Hum ne subah ki, badshahat bhi Allah ke liye subah hui; tareef Allah ke liye hai. Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin; woh akela hai, beshareek. Badshahat usi ki hai, tareef usi ki hai; woh har cheez par qadir hai. Ae mere Rab! Is din ki bhalai aur baad ki bhalai Tujhse mangta hun; is din ke shar aur baad ke shar se teri panah chahta hun. Ae mere Rab! Susti aur buri budhape se teri panah chahta hun. Ae mere Rab! Aag ke azab aur qabr ke azab se teri panah chahta hun. [Subah ka zikr; sham ko sham ke andaz mein]"
"88","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Tere sath hum ne subah ki, tere sath sham ki, tere sath jeete hain, tere sath marte hain; teri hi taraf lautna hai. [Subah ka zikr]"
"89","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Tere sath hum ne sham ki, tere sath subah ki, tere sath jeete hain, tere sath marte hain; teri hi taraf thikana hai. [Sham ka zikr]"
"90","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Tu hi mera Rab hai; tere siwa koi mabud nahin; Tune mujhe paida kiya, main tera banda hun; bhar-sak tere ahad aur wade par hun; kiye ki burai se teri panah chahta hun; mujh par teri nemat ka iqrar karta hun, apne gunah ka iqrar karta hun; mujhe bakhsh de; tere siwa gunah koi nahin bakhshta. [Sayyidul-istighfar; subah-sham padhe]"
"91","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Main ne subah ki; Tujhe, tere arsh uthane walon ko, tere farishton ko aur teri sari makhluq ko gawah banata hun ke Tu hi Allah hai; tere siwa koi mabud nahin, akela, beshareek; Muhammad tere bande aur rasul hain. [Char bar padhe; sham ko sham ke andaz mein]"
"92","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Mujh tak ya teri makhluq mein se kisi tak jo nemat pahunchi—woh sirf teri taraf se hai, tera koi shareek nahin; tareef teri hi hai, shukr tera hi hai. [Subah ka zikr; sham ko sham ke andaz mein]"
"93","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Mere jism mein mujhe aafiyat de; ae Allah! Meri samaat mehfooz rakh; ae Allah! Meri basarat mehfooz rakh; tere siwa koi mabud nahin. Ae Allah! Main kufr aur faqr se teri panah chahta hun; qabr ke azab se teri panah chahta hun; tere siwa koi mabud nahin. [Teen bar padhe]"
"94","[AI-translation] Allah mujhe kafi hai; us ke siwa koi mabud nahin; usi par bharosa kiya; wahi arshe-azeem ka Rab hai. [Saat bar padhe]"
"95","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Main duniya-aakhirat mein teri maafi aur aafiyat mangta hun. Ae Allah! Mere deen, duniya, ahal aur maal mein teri maafi aur aafiyat mangta hun. Ae Allah! Mere aib dhaanp de, mere darr se aman de. Ae Allah! Mujhe aage, peeche, daayein, baayein aur upar se mehfooz rakh; neeche se achanak pakad se teri azmat ki panah chahta hun."
"96","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Ghaib-hazir ke janne wale, aasmanon-zameen ke paida karne wale, har cheez ke Rab aur malik! Main gawahi deta hun ke tere siwa koi mabud nahin; apne nafs ke shar se, shaitan aur us ke jaal ke shar se, apne upar burai karne ya kisi musalman tak pahunchane se teri panah chahta hun. [Subah-sham padhe]"
"97","[AI-translation] Allah ke naam se—jis ke naam ke sath aasman-zameen mein koi cheez nuqsan nahin deti; wahi sunne wala, janne wala hai. [Teen bar padhe]"
"98","[AI-translation] Rab ke taur par Allah se, deen ke taur par Islam se, nabi ke taur par Muhammad se main razi hun. [Teen bar padhe]"
"99","[AI-translation] Ae zinda, ae qayam rakhne wale! Teri rahmat se madad chahta hun; mere sare kaam sanwar de; palak jhapakne tak bhi mujhe mere hawale na kar."
"100","[AI-translation] Hum ne subah ki, badshahat bhi Rabbul-aalamin Allah ke liye subah hui. Ae Allah! Is din ki bhalai mangta hun: us ki fatah, madad, nur, barkat aur hidayat; is mein jo shar aur baad mein jo shar us se teri panah chahta hun. Hum ne sham ki, badshahat bhi Rabbul-aalamin Allah ke liye sham hui. Ae Allah! Is raat ki bhalai mangta hun: us ki fatah, madad, nur, barkat aur hidayat; is mein jo shar aur baad mein jo shar us se teri panah chahta hun."
"101","[AI-translation] Hum ne Islam ki fitrat par, ikhlas ke kalime par, hamare Nabi Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke deen par, aur hamare walid Ibrahim ki millat par subah ki, yaksu musalman hokar; aur woh mushrikon mein se na the."
"102","[AI-translation] Allah pak hai aur tareef usi ki hai. [Sau bar padhe]"
"103","[AI-translation] Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin; woh akela hai, beshareek. Badshahat usi ki hai, tareef usi ki hai; woh har cheez par qadir hai. [Subah sau bar ya susti ke khilaf ek bar, ya das bar padhe]"
"104","[AI-translation] Allah pak hai aur tareef usi ki hai, us ki makhluq ki tadad ke barabar, us ki zaat ki raza ke barabar, us ke arsh ke wazan ke barabar, aur us ke kalimaat ki siyahi ke barabar. [Subah teen bar padhe]"
"105","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Main Tujhse faidemand ilm, pakeeza rozi aur qubul hone wala amal mangta hun. [Subah padhe]"
"106","[AI-translation] Main Allah se maghfirat chahta hun aur us ki taraf tauba karta hun. [Din mein sau bar padhe]"
"107","[AI-translation] Allah ke kamil kalimaat ki panah chahta hun us ki makhluq ke shar se. [Sham teen bar padhe]"
"108","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Hamare Nabi Muhammad par salat wa salam bhej. [Das bar padhe]"
"109","[AI-translation] Dono hatheliyan jode, un mein halka phunke aur un mein Surah Al-Ikhlas, Al-Falaq aur An-Naas padhe; phir un se jism par jahan tak ho sake phere, sar, chehre aur jism ke agle hisse se shuru kare. [Yeh teen bar kare.] [Sone se pehle padhe]"
"110","[AI-translation] Allah; us ke siwa koi mabud nahin; woh zinda hai, qayam rakhne wala hai; use oongh-neend nahin pakadti. Aasmanon-zameen mein jo hai usi ka hai. Us ki ijazat ke baghair us ke pas kaun sifarish karega? Un ke aage-peeche jo hai woh janta hai; us ke ilm mein se kuch nahin gherte—woh jo chahe us ke siwa. Us ki kursi aasmanon-zameen ko ghere hai; un ki hifazat use thakati nahin; woh buland, Azeem hai. [Aayatul-Kursi; sone se pehle padhe]"
"111","[AI-translation] Rasul iman laya us par jo us ke Rab ki taraf se us par nazil hua, aur momin bhi. Sab Allah par, us ke farishton par, us ki kitabon par aur us ke rasulon par iman lae. Hum us ke rasulon mein se kisi ke darmiyan farq nahin karte. Aur unhon ne kaha: Hum ne suna aur ata'at ki; teri maghfirat [mange hain], ae hamare Rab; teri hi taraf lautna hai. Allah kisi jaan par us ki taqat se zyada bojh nahin dalta; us ke liye hai jo us ne kamaya aur us par hai jo us ne kiya. Ae hamare Rab! Agar hum bhulein ya khata karein to hamari pakad na kar. Ae hamare Rab! Hum par aisa bojh na daal jaisa hum se pehlon par dala. Ae hamare Rab! Hum par woh na laad jis ki hum mein taqat nahin; aur hum se darguzar kar, hamein bakhsh de, hum par raham kar; Tu hamara Mawla hai; kafir qaum ke muqable hamari madad kar. [surah Al-Baqarah:285-286; sone se pehle padhe]"
"112","[AI-translation] Tere naam se, ae mere Rab, main ne pehlu [bistar par] rakha, aur Tere sath uthata hun; agar Tu meri ruh rok le to us par raham kar; aur agar Tu use chhod de to us ki hifazat kar jis se Tu apne nek bandon ki hifazat karta hai."
"113","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Tune meri ruh paida ki aur Tu use wafat dega; us ki maut aur zindagi tere liye hai; agar Tu use zinda rakhe to us ki hifazat kar, aur agar Tu use maut de to use bakhsh de. Ae Allah! Main Tujhse aafiyat mangta hun."
"114","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Jis din Tu apne bandon ko uthayega mujhe apne azab se bacha. [Teen bar padhe]"
"115","[AI-translation] Tere naam se, ae Allah, marta hun aur jeeta hun."
"116","[AI-translation] Allah pak hai [taintees bar], tareef Allah ke liye hai [taintees bar], Allah sab se bada hai [chauntees bar]. [Sone se pehle padhe]"
"117","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Saat aasmanon ke Rab, zameen ke Rab aur arshe-azeem ke Rab; hamare Rab aur har cheez ke Rab; dane aur guthli ko cheerhne wale; Taurat, Injeel aur Furqan nazil karne wale! Har cheez ke shar se teri panah chahta hun jis ki peshani Tune pakdi hai. Ae Allah! Tu Awwal hai; Tujhse pehle kuch na tha; Tu Aakhir hai; Tere baad kuch na hoga; Tu Zahir hai; Tujhse upar kuch nahin; Tu Batin hai; Tujhse neeche [Tujhse chhipa] kuch nahin; hamara qarz ada kar de aur hamein faqr se ghani kar de."
"118","[AI-translation] Sari tareefein us Allah ke liye hain, jis ne hamein khilaya aur pilaya, hamein kafi hua aur hamein thikana diya; aur kitne hain jinhein na kafayat hai na thikana."
"119","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Ghaib-hazir ke janne wale, aasmanon-zameen ke paida karne wale, har cheez ke Rab aur malik! Main gawahi deta hun ke tere siwa koi mabud nahin; apne nafs ke shar se, shaitan aur us ke jaal ke shar se, apne upar burai karne ya kisi musalman tak pahunchane se teri panah chahta hun. [Sone se pehle padhe]"
"120","[AI-translation] Surah As-Sajdah [surah 32] aur Surah Al-Mulk [surah 67] padhe. [Sone se pehle padhe]"
"121","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Main ne apni jaan tere supurd ki, apna kaam tere supurd kiya, apna chehra teri taraf kiya, apni peeth teri taraf lagao; teri [rahmat ki] raghbat aur tere [azab ke] khauf ke sath; Tujhse na koi panah hai na najaat magar teri taraf; main teri kitab par iman laya jo Tune nazil ki aur tere Nabi par jo Tune bheja. [Sone se pehle padhe; yeh us raat ka aakhri kalam ho]"
"122","[AI-translation] Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin; woh akela, Qahhar hai; aasmanon-zameen aur dono ke darmiyan jo hai ka Rab; Azeez, Ghaffar hai. [Raat ko jaagkar karwat lete waqt padhe]"
"123","[AI-translation] Allah ke kamil kalimaat ki panah chahta hun us ke ghazab se, us ke azab se, us ke bandon ke shar se, shaitanon ke waswason se aur un ke hazir hone se. [Khauf aur neend na aane par padhe]"
"124","[AI-translation] Apne baayein taraf [teen bar] halka thuke. [Bura khwab dekhe to kare]"
"125","[AI-translation] Shaitan se aur dekhe hue ke shar se Allah ki panah mange [teen bar]. [Bura khwab dekhe to]"
"126","[AI-translation] Use kisi se bayan na kare. [Bura khwab dekhe to]"
"127","[AI-translation] Jis karwat tha us se dusri karwat le. [Bura khwab dekhe to]"
"128","[AI-translation] Uthe aur chahe to namaz padhe. [Bura khwab dekhe to]"
"129","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Mujhe un ke sath hidayat de jinhein Tune hidayat di; mujhe un ke sath aafiyat de jinhein Tune aafiyat di; mujhe un ke sath apna dost bana jinhein Tune dost banaya; mujhe jo diya us mein barkat de; apne faisle ke shar se mujhe bacha; beshak Tu faisla karta hai, Tujh par faisla nahin hota; jise Tu dost banae woh zaleel nahin hota, jise Tu dushman rakhe woh azeez nahin hota; Tu babarkat aur buland hai, ae hamare Rab. [Witr mein qunut ki dua]"
"130","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Tere ghazab se teri raza ki, teri saza se tere maaf karne ki panah chahta hun; Tujhse teri hi panah chahta hun; teri tareef gin nahin sakta; Tu waisa hi hai jaisi Tune apni tareef ki. [Witr ke sajde mein padhe]"
"131","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Hum teri hi ibadat karte hain, tere liye namaz padhte aur sajda karte hain, teri taraf daudte aur khidmat karte hain; teri rahmat ki ummeed rakhte hain, tere azab se darte hain; beshak tera azab kafiron ko pahunchne wala hai. Ae Allah! Hum Tujhse madad mangte hain, Tujhse maghfirat mangte hain, teri khub tareef karte hain, teri nashukri nahin karte, Tujh par iman late hain, tere aage jhukte hain, aur jo tera inkar kare us se alag hote hain. [Witr mein qunut ki dua]"
"132","[AI-translation] Pak Badshah [Allah] ki paki. [Witr ke baad teen bar padhe]"
"133","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Main tera banda hun, tere bande ka beta, teri bandi ka beta; meri peshani tere hath mein hai; mere baare mein tera hukm jari hai, mere baare mein tera faisla adl hai; tere har naam ke waste Tujhse mangta hun jis se Tune apne aap ko pukara, ya use apni kitab mein nazil kiya, ya apni makhluq mein se kisi ko sikhaya, ya apne pas ghaib ke ilm mein mehfooz rakha: Quran ko mere dil ki bahar, mere seenay ka nur, mere gham ki jila aur meri fikr ka khatma bana de. [Gham aur pareshani par padhe]"
"134","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Main fikr aur gham se, aajizi aur susti se, buzdili aur bukhl se, qarz ke bojh se aur logon ke ghalbe se teri panah chahta hun."
"135","[AI-translation] Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin; woh Azeem, Haleem hai; Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin; woh arshe-azeem ka Rab hai; Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin; woh aasmanon ka Rab, zameen ka Rab aur arshe-kareem ka Rab hai. [Pareshani par padhe]"
"136","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Teri rahmat ki ummeed rakhta hun; mujhe palak jhapakne tak bhi mere hawale na kar; mere sare kaam sanwar de; tere siwa koi mabud nahin."
"137","[AI-translation] Tere siwa koi mabud nahin; Tu pak hai; beshak main zalimon mein se tha. [Pareshani ki dua]"
"138","[AI-translation] Allah, Allah; mera Rab hai; us ke sath kisi ko shareek nahin karta. [Pareshani par padhe]"
"139","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Hum Tujhe un ki gardanon mein [un ke khilaf] dalte hain aur un ke sharon se teri panah chahte hain. [Dushman ke khauf par padhe]"
"140","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Tu mera bazu aur madadgar hai; Tere sath hilta hun, Tere sath hamla karta hun, Tere sath ladta hun. [Dushman se muqable par padhe]"
"141","[AI-translation] Allah mujhe kafi hai; aur woh behtareen Wakeel hai. [Dushman ke muqable par padhe]"
"142","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Saat aasmanon ke Rab aur arshe-azeem ke Rab! Makhluq mein se falan bin falan aur us ke giroh ke khilaf mera padosi [muhafiz] ban ja; ke un mein se koi mujh par zyadati kare ya sarkashi kare; teri panah azeez hai, teri tareef buland hai; tere siwa koi mabud nahin. [Zalim ke khauf par padhe; naam ki jagah zikr kare]"
"143","[AI-translation] Allah sab se bada hai; Allah apni sari makhluq se zyada azeez hai; Allah mere khauf aur khatre se zyada azeez hai. Us Allah ki panah chahta hun jis ke siwa koi mabud nahin, jo saat aasmanon ko baghair us ke izn ke zameen par girne se roke hue hai, tere bande falan, us ke lashkaron, pairukaron aur himaqatiyon ke shar se, jinnon aur insanon mein se. Ae Allah! Un ke shar ke khilaf mera padosi ban ja; teri tareef buland hai, teri panah azeez hai, tera naam babarkat hai; tere siwa koi mabud nahin."
"144","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Kitab nazil karne wale, jald hisab lene wale! Girohon [kuffar] ko shikast de; ae Allah! Unhein shikast de aur hila de. [Dushman ke khilaf padhe]"
"145","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Jis tarah chahe un ke khilaf mujhe kafi ho ja. [Dushman ke khilaf padhe]"
"146","[AI-translation] Allah ki panah mange; shaitane-rajeem se Allah ki panah ka iqrar kare. [Waswase par kare]"
"147","[AI-translation] Jis cheez mein shak ho use chhod de. [Waswase par]"
"148","[AI-translation] Allah aur us ke rasulon par iman laya, kahe. Phir yeh aayat padhe: Wohi Awwal hai aur Aakhir hai, Zahir hai aur Batin hai; woh har cheez janne wala hai. [surah Al-Hadeed:3 – Waswase par padhe]"
"149","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Mujhe apne halal se haram se bekhabar kar de, aur apne fazl se apne siwa se ghani kar de. [Qarz par padhe]"
"150","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Main fikr aur gham se, aajizi aur susti se, buzdili aur bukhl se, qarz ke bojh se aur logon ke ghalbe se teri panah chahta hun. [Qarz aur pareshani par]"
"151","[AI-translation] Shaitane-rajeem se Allah ki panah chahta hun, kahe [phir baayein teen bar halka thuke]. [Ghusse par]"
"152","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Aasan nahin magar jise Tu aasan kare; aur Tu gham ko jab chahe aasan kar deta hai. [Kaam mushkil lage par padhe]"
"153","[AI-translation] Jo banda gunah kare phir wuzu khub kare, phir khada hokar do rakat namaz padhe, phir Allah se maghfirat mange to Allah use bakhsh deta hai. [Gunah par kare]"
"154","[AI-translation] Us se Allah ki panah mange, shaitane-rajeem se Allah ki panah ke iqrar se. [Shaitan ke waswase ke khilaf]"
"155","[AI-translation] Azan di jaae. [Naumaulud ke daayein kaan mein azan]"
"156","[AI-translation] Zikr padhe aur Quran ki tilawat kare. [Pareshani aur waswase par]"
"157","[AI-translation] Allah ne taqdeer ki aur jo chaha kiya, kahe. [Napansandeeda kaam par kahe]"
"158","[AI-translation] Allah tumhein diye hue mein barkat de, tum dene wale ka shukr ada karo, woh jawani ko pahunche aur tum us ki neki pao. [Sahibe-aulad se kahe]"
"159","[AI-translation] Tum dono ko Allah ke kamil kalimaat ki panah mein deta hun har shaitan aur zehrile janwar se, aur har hasad bhari nazar se. [Bacchon ke liye dua]"
"160","[AI-translation] Koi harj nahin; inshaAllah pakeezagi hai. [Mareez se kahe]"
"161","[AI-translation] Azeem Allah se—arshe-azeem ke Rab se—tumhein shifa dene ki dua karta hun. [Mareez se saat bar kahe]"
"162","[AI-translation] Jab koi apne musalman bhai ki beemari mein ayadat kare to baithne tak jannat ke bagh mein chale; baithe to rahmat use dhaanp le. Subah jaae to sham tak sattar hazar farishte us ke liye salat padhte hain; sham ko jaae to subah tak sattar hazar farishte us ke liye salat padhte hain. [Ayadat ki fazeelat]"
"163","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Mujhe bakhsh de, mujh par raham kar aur mujhe aala rafeeq [jannat mein nekon] se mila de. [Maut ke marz mein padhe]"
"164","[AI-translation] Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin; beshak maut ki sakraat hain. [Maut ke waqt padhe]"
"165","[AI-translation] Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin, Allah sab se bada hai; Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin akela; Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin akela, beshareek; badshahat usi ki hai, tareef usi ki hai; Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin; Allah ke baghair koi taqat-quvvat nahin. [Maut ke waqt padhe]"
"166","[AI-translation] Jis ka aakhri kalam Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin ho woh jannat mein dakhil hoga. [Muhtazar ko talqeen kare]"
"167","[AI-translation] Beshak hum Allah ke hain aur usi ki taraf lautne wale hain. Ae Allah! Meri museebat mein mujhe ajr de aur is se behtar de. [Museebat par padhe]"
"168","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Falan ko bakhsh de, hidayatyaftaon mein us ka darja buland kar; peeche rehne wali [nasl] mein us ka janasheen ban; hamein aur use bakhsh de ae Rabbul-aalamin; us ki qabr kushada kar aur us mein us ke liye nur de. [Mayyat ke liye dua; naam ki jagah zikr kare]"
"169","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Use bakhsh de, us par raham kar, use aafiyat de, use maaf kar; us ki mehmaani izzat wali kar, dakhila kushada kar; use pani, barf aur olon se dho de; safed kapde ke mail se pak karne ki tarah use khataon se pak kar; use us ke ghar se behtar ghar, ahal se behtar ahal, biwi se behtar biwi de; use jannat mein dakhil kar; qabr aur aag ke azab se use bacha. [Janaze ki dua]"
"170","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Hamare zinda-murda, hazir-ghaib, chhote-bade, mard-aurat ko bakhsh de. Ae Allah! Hum mein se jise zinda rakhe Islam par zinda rakh, jise maut de iman par maut de. Ae Allah! Hamein us ke ajr se mahroom na kar, us ke baad hamein gumrah na kar. [Janaze ki dua]"
"171","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Falan bin falan tere zimme aur teri panah ke ahad mein hai; use qabr ke fitne aur aag ke azab se bacha; Tu hi wafa aur haqq wala hai; use bakhsh de, us par raham kar; beshak Tu hi bahut bakhshne wala, nihayat raham wala hai. [Janaze ki dua]"
"172","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Tera banda aur teri bandi ka beta teri rahmat ka mohtaj hua; Tu us ke azab ka mohtaj nahin; nek hua to us ki nekiyan badha de, bura hua to use maaf kar de. [Janaze ki dua]"
"173","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Use qabr ke azab se bacha. [Bacche ke janaze mein:] Ae Allah! Use walidain ke liye peshrau, zakheera aur qubul shafaat karne wala bana. Ae Allah! Us se un ke tarazu bhari kar, us se un ke ujoor bade kar, use saleh mominon se mila, use Ibrahim ki kafalat mein de, apni rahmat se use jahannam ke azab se bacha; use us ke ghar se behtar ghar, ahal se behtar ahal de. Ae Allah! Hamare aglon, bacchon aur iman mein hum se sabqat karne walon ko bakhsh de. [Bacche ke janaze mein padhe]"
"174","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Use hamare liye peshrau, pehle jaane wala aur ajr bana. [Bacche ke janaze mein padhe]"
"175","[AI-translation] Beshak liya Allah ka hai, diya Allah ka hai; us ke pas har cheez muqarrar muddat par hai; sabr kar aur ajr ki ummeed rakh. Allah tera ajr bada kare, tera pursa khubsurat kare aur tere mayyat ko bakhshe. [Taziyat mein kahe]"
"176","[AI-translation] Allah ke naam se aur Allah ke rasul ki sunnat par. [Mayyat ko qabr mein rakhte waqt kahe]"
"177","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Use bakhsh de; ae Allah! Use sabit rakh. [Dafn ke baad mayyat ke liye dua]"
"178","[AI-translation] Ae momin-musalman basti walo! Tum par salam; inshaAllah hum bhi tum se milne wale hain; Allah hamare aglon-pichhlon par raham kare; hamare aur tumhare liye aafiyat mangta hun. [Qabr ki ziyarat mein kahe]"
"179","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Us ki bhalai mangta hun, us ke shar se teri panah chahta hun. [Hawa chale par padhe]"
"180","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Us ki bhalai, us mein jo bhalai aur jis ke sath bheji gae us ki bhalai mangta hun; us ke shar, us mein jo shar aur jis ke sath bheji gae us ke shar se teri panah chahta hun. [Hawa chale par padhe]"
"181","[AI-translation] Pak woh jis ke hamd se garaj tasbeeh karta hai aur farishte us ke darr se. [Garaj sunkar padhe]"
"182","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Hamein madad dene wali, khushgawar, ugane wali, faidemand-ghair nuqsandeh, jald-ghair der wali barish de. [Barish ki dua mein padhe]"
"183","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Hamein barish de, ae Allah! Hamein barish de, ae Allah! Hamein barish de."
"184","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Apne bandon-janwaron ko pila, apni rahmat phaila, apni murda basti zinda kar. [Barish ki dua mein]"
"185","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Faidemand barish [de]. [Barish barse par padhe]"
"186","[AI-translation] Allah ke fazl aur rahmat se hum par barish hui. [Barish ke baad kahe]"
"187","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Hamare gird [barsa], hum par nahin; ae Allah! Teelon, bulandiyon, wadiyon aur darakht ugne ki jaghon par. [Zyada barish mein padhe]"
"188","[AI-translation] Allah sab se bada hai. Ae Allah! Aman-iman, salamti-Islam aur ae hamare Rab, teri pasand-raza ke kaam ki taufeeq ke sath chaand chadha; mera bhi Rab, tera bhi Rab Allah hai. [Chaand dekhkar padhe]"
"189","[AI-translation] Pyas gae, ragein tar huiin, inshaAllah ajr sabit hua. [Iftar mein padhe]"
"190","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Teri har cheez ko gherne wali rahmat ke waste Tujhse maghfirat mangta hun. [Iftar mein padhe]"
"191","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi khana shuru kare to Allah ke naam se kahe; shuru mein bhule to yaad aane par kahe: shuru-aakhir mein Allah ke naam se. [Khane se pehle]"
"192","[AI-translation] Allah jise khilae woh kahe: Ae Allah! Is mein hamein barkat de aur is se behtar khila. Allah jise doodh pilae woh kahe: Ae Allah! Is mein hamein barkat de aur hamein zyada de."
"193","[AI-translation] Sari tareefein us Allah ke liye hain, jis ne mujhe yeh khilaya aur meri kisi taqat-quvvat ke baghair mujhe yeh rozi di. [Khane ke baad padhe]"
"194","[AI-translation] Allah ke liye bahut, pakeeza, babarkat tareef; badla na diya ja sake, na chhodi ja sake, na beniyazi ho sake [tareef]; ae hamare Rab. [Khane ke baad]"
"195","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Unhein jo rozi di us mein barkat de, unhein bakhsh de, un par raham kar. [Mezban ke liye dua]"
"196","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Jis ne mujhe khilaya use khila, jis ne mujhe pilaya use pila. [Khilane-pilane wale ke liye dua]"
"197","[AI-translation] Rozedar tumhare pas iftar karein, tumhara khana nek khaein, farishte tum par salat bhejein. [Iftar karane wale ke liye dua]"
"198","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi bulaya jaae to dawat qubul kare; rozedar ho to [mezban ke liye] dua kare, rozedar na ho to khaae. [Dawat qubul karne ka adab]"
"199","[AI-translation] Main rozedar hun, main rozedar hun. [Buri baat par rozedar yeh kahe]"
"200","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Hamare phalon mein barkat de, hamare shahar mein barkat de, hamare sa'a mein barkat de, hamare mudd mein barkat de. [Sa'a-mudd paimane hain]"
"201","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi chheenkhe to alhamdulillah kahe; us ka bhai ya sathi use yarhamukallah kahe; woh use yarhamukallah kahe to woh kahe: Allah tumhein hidayat de aur haal durust kare. [Chheenk ka adab]"
"202","[AI-translation] Allah tujhe barkat de, tujh par barkat nazil kare aur tum dono ko bhalai mein jode. [Shadishuda se kahe]"
"203","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi aurat se shaadi kare ya laundi khareede to kahe: Ae Allah! Us ki bhalai aur jis tabiyat par Tune use paida kiya us ki bhalai mangta hun; us ke shar aur jis tabiyat par Tune use paida kiya us ke shar se teri panah chahta hun. Oont khareede to kohan pakadkar yahi kahe."
"204","[AI-translation] Allah ke naam se; ae Allah! Shaitan ko hum se door rakh, hamein jo dega [aulad] us se bhi shaitan ko door rakh. [Biwi ke pas jaane se pehle kahe]"
"205","[AI-translation] Shaitane-rajeem se Allah ki panah chahta hun. [Ghusse aur waswase mein kahe]"
"206","[AI-translation] Sari tareefein us Allah ke liye hain, jis ne tujhe jis aazmaish mein dala us se mujhe aafiyat di aur apni bahut-si makhluq par mujhe fazeelat di. [Aazmaish wale ko dekhkar chhipe kahe]"
"207","[AI-translation] Ae mere Rab, mujhe bakhsh de aur meri tauba qubul kar; beshak Tu hi bahut tauba qubul karne wala, bahut bakhshne wala hai. [Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ek majlis mein yeh bahut bar kehte the]"
"208","[AI-translation] Ae Allah, Tu pak hai; teri hi tareef hai; gawahi deta hun ke tere siwa koi mabud nahin; Tujhse maghfirat chahta hun aur teri taraf tauba karta hun. [Majlis se uthte waqt padhe; majlis ka kaffara]"
"209","[AI-translation] Allah tujhe behtareen badla de. [Ehsan karne wale se kahe]"
"210","[AI-translation] Jo Surah Kahaf ke shuru se das aayatein hifz kare Dajjal se mehfooz rahega; har namaz ke aakhri tashahhud ke baad Dajjal ke fitne se Allah ki panah mange. [Dajjal ke fitne se hifazat]"
"211","[AI-translation] Jis ke liye tune mujhse muhabbat ki [Allah] woh tujhse muhabbat kare. [Muhabbat ki baat ke jawab mein]"
"212","[AI-translation] Allah tere ahal-maal mein tujhe barkat de. [Maal-ahal ki tareef karne wale se kahe]"
"213","[AI-translation] Allah tere ahal-maal mein tujhe barkat de; qarz ka badla sirf tareef aur adaygi hai. [Qarz ada karne wale se kahe]"
"214","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Jante hue tere sath shirk karne se teri panah chahta hun; anjane ke liye Tujhse maghfirat mangta hun. [Chhipe shirk se hifazat ki dua]"
"215","[AI-translation] Allah tujhe bhi barkat de. [Allah tujhe barkat de—ka jawab]"
"216","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Bura shagun sirf tere shagun se, bhalai sirf teri bhalai se; tere siwa koi mabud nahin. [Bura shagun lage par padhe]"
"217","[AI-translation] Allah ke naam se, tareef Allah ke liye hai. Pak woh jis ne hamare liye yeh musakhkhar kiya; hum is ki taqat na rakhte the; beshak apne Rab ki taraf lautne wale hain. Tareef Allah ke liye hai [teen bar]; Allah sab se bada hai [teen bar]. Tu pak hai ae Allah; apni jaan par zulm kiya; mujhe bakhsh de; tere siwa gunah koi nahin bakhshta. [Sawari par chadhkar padhe]"
"218","[AI-translation] Allah sab se bada hai [teen bar]. Pak woh jis ne hamare liye yeh musakhkhar kiya; hum is ki taqat na rakhte the; beshak apne Rab ki taraf lautne wale hain. Ae Allah! Is safar mein Tujhse neki-taqwa, teri pasand ka amal mangte hain. Ae Allah! Yeh safar hum par aasan kar, doori lapet de. Ae Allah! Safar mein sathi, ahal mein khaleefa Tu hi hai. Ae Allah! Safar ki mashaqqat, bure manzar, maal-ahal mein buri wapsi se teri panah chahta hun. [Wapsi mein is mein izafa kare: lautne wale, tauba karne wale, ibadat karne wale, apne Rab ki tareef karne wale.] [Safar par nikalkar padhe]"
"219","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Saat aasmanon aur chhae hue ke Rab, saat zameenon aur uthae hue ke Rab, shaitanon aur gumrah kiye ke Rab, hawaon aur udae hue ke Rab! Is basti ki bhalai, is ke bashindon ki bhalai aur is mein jo bhalai mangta hun; is ke shar, is ke bashindon ke shar aur is mein jo shar us se teri panah chahta hun. [Basti mein dakhil hokar padhe]"
"220","[AI-translation] Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin; woh akela hai, beshareek. Badshahat usi ki hai, tareef usi ki hai; zinda karta hai aur maut deta hai; woh zinda hai, marta nahin; bhalai us ke hath mein hai; woh har cheez par qadir hai. [Bazaar mein dakhil hokar padhe]"
"221","[AI-translation] Allah ke naam se. [Sawari par chadhte waqt kahe]"
"222","[AI-translation] Tujhe Allah ke supurd karta hun jis ke supurd zae nahin hote. [Safar karne wale se kahe]"
"223","[AI-translation] Allah ke supurd karta hun tera deen, teri amanat, aur tere amal ka khatma. [Safar karne wale se kahe]"
"224","[AI-translation] Allah tujhe taqwa ka tosha de, tera gunah bakhsh de, jahan bhi ho bhalai aasan kare. [Safar karne wale se kahe]"
"225","[AI-translation] Jabir ne kaha: Hum jab chadhte to takbeer kehte, jab utarte to tasbeeh kehte. [Safar ka adab]"
"226","[AI-translation] Sunne wala Allah ke hamd aur hum par us ki aazmaish ki khubi ke sath sune; ae hamare Rab, hamara sathi ban aur hum par fazl kar, aag se Allah ki panah mangte hue. [Safar mein teelay par chadhkar padhe]"
"227","[AI-translation] Allah ke kamil kalimaat ki panah chahta hun us ki makhluq ke shar se. [Kisi jagah thahre par padhe]"
"228","[AI-translation] Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin; woh akela hai, beshareek; badshahat usi ki hai, tareef usi ki hai; woh har cheez par qadir hai. Lautne wale, tauba karne wale, ibadat karne wale, apne Rab ki tareef karne wale. Allah ne apna wada saccha kiya, apne bande ki madad ki, girohon ko tanha shikast di. [Safar se wapsi par padhe]"
"229","[AI-translation] Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab khushi ki baat aati to kehte: Sari tareefein us Allah ke liye hain jis ki nemat se nekiyan mukammal hoti hain. Aur jab napasand baat aati to kehte: Har haal mein Allah ki tareef hai. [Khushi ya pareshani par kahe]"
"230","[AI-translation] Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo mujh par ek bar durud bheje Allah us par das bar rahmat bhejta hai. [Nabi par durud ki fazeelat]"
"231","[AI-translation] Aur Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Meri qabr ko eid na banao aur mujh par durud bhejo; tumhara durud mujhe pahunchta hai jahan bhi ho. [Nabi par durud ki fazeelat]"
"232","[AI-translation] Aur Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Bakheel woh hai jis ke samne mera zikr ho aur mujh par durud na bheje. [Nabi par durud ki fazeelat]"
"233","[AI-translation] Aur Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ke saiyah farishte zameen mein phirte hain jo meri ummat ka salam mujhe pahunchate hain. [Nabi par durud ki fazeelat]"
"234","[AI-translation] Aur Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo mujh par salam bheje Allah meri ruh lautata hai yahan tak ke main us ke salam ka jawab dun. [Nabi par durud ki fazeelat]"
"235","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum jannat mein dakhil na hoge jab tak iman na lao, aur iman na laoge jab tak aapas mein muhabbat na karo. Kya tumhein woh cheez na bataun jis se aapas mein muhabbat karo: aapas mein salam phailao. [Salam ki fazeelat]"
"236","[AI-translation] Teen cheezein jo inhein jama kare us ne iman jama kiya: apne nafs se insaf, sab ko salam, aur tangi mein kharch. [Salam ki fazeelat]"
"237","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar se: Ek aadmi ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se pucha: Kaunsa Islam behtar hai? Farmaya: Khana khilana, aur jaan-pehchan ho ya na ho salam karna. [Salam ki fazeelat]"
"238","[AI-translation] Jab ahle-kitab tumhein salam karein to kaho: Wa alaikum (aur tum par). [Ghair-muslim ko salam ka adab]"
"239","[AI-translation] Jab murghe ki baang suno to Allah se us ka fazl mango; us ne farishta dekha hai. Aur jab gadhe ki cheekh suno to shaitan se Allah ki panah mango; us ne shaitan dekha hai. [Janwaron ki awaz ka adab]"
"240","[AI-translation] Jab raat mein kutton ke bhonkne aur gadhon ki cheekh suno to un se Allah ki panah mango; woh dekhte hain jo tum nahin dekhte. [Raat mein janwaron ki awaz ka adab]"
"241","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Jis momin ko main ne gaali di use qayamat ke din us ke liye teri qurbat bana de. [Ghusse se kisi ko bura kahe to]"
"242","[AI-translation] Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi sathi ki tareef karne par majboor ho to kahe: Falan ko aisa samajhta hun, Allah us ka hisab lene wala hai; Allah ke baare mein kisi ki pakeezgi bayan nahin karta; use—agar yeh janta ho—aisa-aisa samajhta hun. [Tareef ka adab]"
"243","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Woh jo kehte hain us se meri pakad na kar, jo nahin jante use bakhsh de, woh jo samajhte hain us se mujhe behtar bana de. [Tareef sunkar]"
"244","[AI-translation] Hazir ae Allah, hazir; hazir, tera koi shareek nahin, hazir; tareef, nemat aur badshahat teri hi hai; tera koi shareek nahin. [Hajj mein talbiya]"
"245","[AI-translation] Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne oont par Kaaba ka tawaf kiya; rukn par aate to haath ki cheez se ishara karke takbeer kehte. [Hajj mein]"
"246","[AI-translation] Ae hamare Rab! Hamein duniya mein bhalai de, aakhirat mein bhi bhalai de, aag ke azab se bacha. [Rukne-yamani-hajre-aswad ke darmiyan padhe]"
"247","[AI-translation] Safa ke qareeb aakar Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne padha: Beshak Safa-Marwa Allah ki nishaniyon mein se hain. Allah ne jis se shuru kiya us se shuru karta hun—Safa se shuru karke us par chadhe Kaaba dekhkar qiblaru hokar Allah ki wahdaniyat bayan ki, takbeer kahi aur kaha: Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin akela, beshareek; badshahat usi ki hai, tareef usi ki hai; woh har cheez par qadir hai; Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin akela; wada poora kiya, bande ki madad ki, girohon ko tanha shikast di; is ke darmiyan dua ki. Yeh teen bar kaha. Marwa par bhi Safa jaisa kiya. [Safa-Marwa mein padhe]"
"248","[AI-translation] Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin; woh akela hai, beshareek. Badshahat usi ki hai, tareef usi ki hai; woh har cheez par qadir hai. [Arfa ke din ki dua]"
"249","[AI-translation] Allah sab se bada hai; Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin. [Arfa mein padhe]"
"250","[AI-translation] Teen jamron par kankadi maarte waqt har kankadi par takbeer kahega; aage badhkar qiblaru hokar haath uthakar pehli-dusri jamra ke baad dua ko khada hoga. Jamratul-aqba ko maarkar har kankadi par takbeer kehkar laut jaaega, wahan khada na hoga. Allahu Akbar. [Kankadi maarne ka adab]"
"251","[AI-translation] Allah pak hai. Allah sab se bada hai. [Hajj mein zyada padhe]"
"252","[AI-translation] Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko jab khushi ki baat aati to Allah ke shukr mein sajde mein gir jaate. [Shukr ka sajda]"
"253","[AI-translation] Jism ki dard wali jagah par haath rakhkar teen bar Allah ke naam se kaho, saat bar kaho: Main jo pata hun aur jis se darta hun us ke shar se Allah aur us ki qudrat ki panah chahta hun. [Dard mein padhe]"
"254","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi bhai, apne ya maal ki pasandeeda cheez dekhe to [barkat ki dua kare]; nazar haqq hai. [Badnazar ka adab]"
"255","[AI-translation] Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin. [Nuqsandeh cheez dekhe par padhe]"
"256","[AI-translation] Allah ke naam se, Allah sab se bada hai. Ae Allah! Tujhse, tere liye; ae Allah! Mujhse qubul kar. [Qurbani mein padhe]"
"257","[AI-translation] Nek-bad koi na laangh sake aise Allah ke kamil kalimaat ki panah chahta hun—us ne jo paida, phailaya aur banaya us ke shar se; aasman se jo utre us ke shar se; us mein jo chadhe us ke shar se; zameen mein jo phailaya us ke shar se; us se jo nikle us ke shar se; raat-din ke fitnon ke shar se; har raat aane wale ke shar se—bhalai lekar aane wale ke siwa; ae Rahman. [Sham ko darr ke waqt padhe]"
"258","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ki qasam, main din mein sattar se zyada bar Allah se maghfirat mangta aur tauba karta hun. [Istighfar ki fazeelat]"
"259","[AI-translation] Aur Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae logo! Allah se tauba karo; main din mein us se sau bar tauba karta hun. [Istighfar ki fazeelat]"
"260","[AI-translation] Us ke siwa koi mabud nahin aise zinda, qayam rakhne wale Allah se maghfirat chahta aur us ki taraf tauba karta hun. [Istighfar]"
"261","[AI-translation] Aur Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Rab bande ke sab se qareeb aakhri raat ke darmiyan hota hai; agar is ghadi Allah ke zikr walon mein ho sako to ho jao. [Raat ke zikr ki fazeelat]"
"262","[AI-translation] Aur Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Banda apne Rab ke sab se qareeb sajde mein hota hai; dua kasrat se karo. [Sajde mein dua ki fazeelat]"
"263","[AI-translation] Aur Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak mere dil par ghaflat aati hai aur main din mein sau bar Allah se maghfirat mangta hun. [Istighfar ki fazeelat]"
"264","[AI-translation] Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo din mein sau bar Allah pak hai aur tareef usi ki hai kahe us ke gunah mita diye jaate hain chahe samandar ke jhaag jaise hon. [Tasbeeh ki fazeelat]"
"265","[AI-translation] Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin; woh akela hai, beshareek. Badshahat usi ki hai, tareef usi ki hai; woh har cheez par qadir hai. [Subah sau bar ka zikr]"
"266","[AI-translation] Allah pak hai aur tareef usi ki hai, azeem Allah pak hai. [Subah-sham sau bar padhe]"
"267","[AI-translation] Allah pak hai, tareef Allah ke liye hai, Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin, Allah sab se bada hai. [Allah ko mehboob kalimaat]"
"268","[AI-translation] Aur Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum mein se koi har din hazaar nekiyan kamane se aajiz hai? Majlis mein se ek sawal karne wale ne pucha: Hum mein se koi hazaar nekiyan kaise kamae? Farmaya: Sau bar tasbeeh kahe, us ke liye hazaar nekiyan likhi jaati hain ya hazaar gunah mita diye jaate hain. [Tasbeeh ki fazeelat]"
"269","[AI-translation] Jo azeem Allah pak hai aur tareef usi ki hai kahe us ke liye jannat mein khajoor ka darakht lagaya jaata hai. [Tasbeeh ki fazeelat]"
"270","[AI-translation] Aur Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae Abdullah bin Qais! Kya tujhe jannat ke khazanon mein se khazana na bataun? Main ne kaha: Kyun nahin, ya Rasulullah. Farmaya: Kaho Allah ke baghair koi taqat-quvvat nahin. [Hauqala ki fazeelat]"
"271","[AI-translation] Allah pak hai, tareef Allah ke liye hai, Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin, Allah sab se bada hai. [Allah ko mehboob kalimaat]"
"272","[AI-translation] Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin; woh akela hai, beshareek, Allah bahut bada hai, tareef Allah ke liye bahut zyada, aalameen ka Rab Allah pak hai, azeez-hakeem Allah ke baghair koi taqat-quvvat nahin. Phir dua kare: Ae Allah! Mujhe bakhsh de, mujh par raham kar, mujhe hidayat de, mujhe rozi de. [Dehati ko sikhaya]"
"273","[AI-translation] Beshak behtareen dua tareef Allah ke liye hai, aur behtareen zikr Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin hai. [Hamd-tahleel ki fazeelat]"
"274","[AI-translation] Baaqi rehne wali nekiyan: Allah pak hai, tareef Allah ke liye hai, Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin, Allah sab se bada hai, Allah ke baghair koi taqat-quvvat nahin. [Baqiyat salihat]"
"275","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr se: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko daayein haath se tasbeeh ginte dekha. [Tasbeeh ka adab]"
"276","[AI-translation] Jab raat chha jaae—ya sham kar lo—to bacchon ko roko, shaitan us waqt phailte hain; raat ki ek ghadi guzre to chhod do. Darwaze band karo aur Allah ka naam lo; shaitan band darwaza nahin kholta. Mashkeeze baandho aur Allah ka naam lo, bartan dhaanpo aur Allah ka naam lo, chahe upar koi cheez rakho, aur chiraagh bujha do. [Sham ke adab]"
